# Recipes

Coming soon — this is the gallery index for end-to-end Reactor recipes:
login forms, master-detail layouts, settings pages, paginated lists,
modal dialogs, multi-step forms, search-with-suggestions, command
palettes, drag-to-reorder, and more. See
[the AI Author Skill](../../_pipeline/ai-author-skill.md) for the
planned surface.

Until the gallery lands, the closest existing pattern coverage is
spread across [Forms](../forms.md), [Collections](../collections.md),
and [Navigation](../navigation.md).
